#. まったく…朝から疲れたな…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Jeez, I'm tired already..."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…１日たりとも、
#. 時間を無駄にしてるヒマはないんだ。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But I don't have time to take even one day off...!"
msgstr ""

#. 気を取り直していかないとな…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I need to get myself going."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ、時間はあるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's still plenty of time left.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>じっとしている気分じゃない。
#. どこかに行ってみようかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't just sit around here. I should head out...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「キーン、コーン…　カーン、コーン」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Ding dong, bing bong*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. えー、校内放送でーす。
#. 午後１０時になりました。
msgctxt "0007 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Mm, ahem, this is a school announcement. It is now 10\n"
"p.m."
msgstr ""

#. ただいまより<CLT 3>“夜時間”<CLT>になります。
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "As such, it is officially <CLT 3>nighttime<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 間もなく食堂はドアをロックされますので、
#. 立ち入り禁止となりま～す。
msgctxt "0009 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Soon the doors to the dining hall will be locked, and\n"
"entry at that point is strictly prohibited."
msgstr ""

#. ではでは、いい夢を。おやすみなさい…
msgctxt "0010 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Okay then...sweet dreams, everyone! Good night, sleep\n"
"tight, don't let the bed bugs bite..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今日も…終わりか……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Another day gone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今日が終わったところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But even though today is over...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“これ”は終わらない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...this \"game\" definitely isn't.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“これ”は…いつまで続くんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long is this gonna keep going...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんな不安を抱えながら…
#. ボクの夜は更けていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>All the stress and anxiety kept me from falling asleep\n"
"until late in the night...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ボクってさ、かわいい子を見ると、
#. じっと見つめてしまうクセがあるんだ。
msgctxt "0016 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Whenever I spot a cute girl, I have a tendency to\n"
"stare."
msgstr ""

#. じっとじっと見つめてしまうんだ。
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "I can't help it—I just gaze with intensity."
msgstr ""

#. さっきだって、駅まで自転車で行って…
msgctxt "0018 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "The other day, I rode my bike to the train station..."
msgstr ""

#. トイレの大きな鏡を、
#. じっと見つめてしまったもの…
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I was in the bathroom, just looking at myself in the\n"
"mirror..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何でもいいから…
#. テレビ番組が見たいな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>God, I want to watch TV. It could be anything, I don't\n"
"care...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>山田クンはきっと…
#. アニメが見たくてしょうがないんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I bet Hifumi really wants to get back to watching\n"
"anime...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラで見張られる生活が…
#. 一体、いつまで続くんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long am I going to be stuck here, being watched by\n"
"all these cameras...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの死から…目を背けちゃいけない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't let myself turn away from Sayaka's death...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんの為にも…
#. ボク自身の為にもだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For Sayaka...and for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ…
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "*Sigh*"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この窓を全開にして…
#. 空気の入れ換えをしてみたい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wish I could just throw open a window and get some\n"
"fresh air in this place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はぁ…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "*Sigh*"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この窓を全開にして…
#. 空気の入れ換えをしてみたい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I wish I could just throw open a window and get some\n"
"fresh air in this place...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>メモ帳がある。
#. けど、メモする内容が思い浮かばない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same notepad from before. I can't think of\n"
"anything I'd want to write down...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>粘着テープクリーナーだ。
#. 残量は相変わらず減ったままだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The lint roller... There's definitely less of it left\n"
"than there was at the start.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ビニールの包装がされてる。
#. まだ未開封の工具セットだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It still hasn't been opened.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まぁ、工具セットなんて使う事はないだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I don't think I need it right now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0034 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0035 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have some time, so maybe I should take a little\n"
"rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>普通のゴミ箱だ。
#. …普通じゃないゴミ箱ってなんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's just a normal trash can. I wonder what an\n"
"*abnormal* trash can would look like...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>紙は、はがしたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I tore the paper off the wall, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの内容を思い出すだけでも、
#. 嫌な気分になる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...just remembering what it said still makes me feel\n"
"queasy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>引き出しのある机だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the same desk with the same few drawers.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここで当たり前に勉強するような…
#. そんな生活が送りたい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If only I had the kind of life where I could use it to\n"
"study like a normal student...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0042 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0043 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
